# Tangled Colony (3/2): "When this creature dies, create X 1/1 black Rat creature tokens with 'This token can't block,' where X is the
# amount of damage dealt to it this turn." Bot1's own Lightning Bolt deals 3 damage to its 3/2 Colony (more than its toughness 2): the
# Colony dies and X = 3, so exactly three Rats enter, all 1/1 black Rat tokens, together with the three Moxen and nothing else.

[Bot1 Deck]
Mox Jet
Mox Pearl
Mox Ruby
Tangled Colony
Lightning Bolt
Swamp x20

[Bot2 Deck]
Island x20

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Mox Jet.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot1.Hand.Mox Pearl.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot1.Hand.Mox Ruby.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
[T3 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Jet.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Pearl.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Tangled Colony.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
? Bot1.Battlefield.Count = 4
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Ruby.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Lightning Bolt.Cast(Bot1.Battlefield.Tangled Colony)
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
? Bot1.Graveyard = Tangled Colony; Lightning Bolt
? Bot1.Battlefield.Count = 6

[Expect]
Bot1.Battlefield.Count = 6
Bot1.Battlefield.Rat Token#1.Power = 1
Bot1.Battlefield.Rat Token#1.Toughness = 1
Bot1.Battlefield.Rat Token#1.Colors = Black
Bot1.Battlefield.Rat Token#1.Token = true
Bot1.Battlefield.Rat Token#3.Power = 1
